    "description": "The Hypersensitive Narcissism Scale (HSNS) is a 10-item self-report measure assessing covert or vulnerable narcissism, characterized by hypersensitivity, entitlement, and a fragile sense of self. It is used in personality research to distinguish the covert narcissistic style from the more overt, grandiose presentation captured by other narcissism instruments.",
